      <h1>Mascot marks</h1>
      <p class="lede">Ten black-and-white logos drawn from the close-up mascot. The aim is the same as a BAPE ape head: one hard silhouette, the same face at every size, and enough of the spikes, the heavy lids, the muzzle, and the blunt that it still reads as this character.</p>
